    <!-- GUIDE CONTENT SECTIONS -->
    <div class="shopify-section shopify-section--guide-content">
        {{!-- <link rel="stylesheet" href="sections/guide-content/guide-content.css" /> --}}
        <section class="guide-content active" id="before-your-treatment-tab">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="accordion">
                    <button
                        class="accordion-button"
                        type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                        data-bs-target="#before-your-treatment-collapse"
                    >
                        Before Your Treatment
                    </button>
                    <div
                        id="before-your-treatment-collapse"
                        class="accordion-collapse show"
                    >
                        <article>
                            <h2>Before Your Treatment</h2>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Wash your hair and scalp thoroughly.</li>
                                <li>Make sure the scalp is clean and free from oils, dry shampoo, styling products and other leave-on products.</li>
                                <li>Wash and sanitize your hands before handling the device.</li>
                                <li>Use clean fingers or a clean comb to section the hair during treatment.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>We recommend performing your treatment <strong>at night.</strong> This allows the Micro-Infusion Hair Serum to remain on your scalp overnight and gives the scalp time to settle after treatment.</p>
                            <div class="c-note c-note--warning">
                                <p><strong>Numbing Cream</strong><br />We do not recommend using numbing cream before or during Micro-Infusion Pro Hair.</p>
                                <p>If treatment feels uncomfortable, use lighter, gentler stamping motions and avoid excessive pressure.</p>
                                <p>Stop treatment if discomfort continues.</p>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="shopify-section shopify-section--guide-content">
        <section class="guide-content" id="quick-start-guide-tab">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="accordion">
                    <button
                        class="accordion-button"
                        type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                        data-bs-target="#quick-start-guide-collapse"
                    >
                        Quick Start Guide
                    </button>
                    <div
                        id="quick-start-guide-collapse"
                        class="accordion-collapse show"
                    >
                        <article>
                            <h2>Quick Start Guide</h2>
                            {{> c-wistia
                                custom-classes="d-none d-lg-block"
                                id="96okj0th48"
                                custom='
                                    <figure>
                                        <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/video-poster.webp" alt="Watch: How To Use" />
                                        <figcaption>
                                            Watch: How To Use
                                        </figcaption>
                                    </figure>
                                '
                            }}
                        </article>
                        {{> c-wistia
                            custom-classes="guide-content__video d-lg-none"
                            id="96okj0th48"
                            custom='
                                <figure>
                                    <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/video-poster.webp" alt="Watch: How To Use" />
                                    <figcaption>
                                        Watch: How To Use
                                    </figcaption>
                                </figure>
                            '
                        }}
                        <div class="c-step-by-step">
                            <div class="c-step-by-step__title">Step-By-Step Guide</div>
                            <div class="c-step-by-step__slider">
                                <div
                                    class="c-swiper"
                                    data-swiper='{
                                        "slidesPerView": 1.098,
                                        "spaceBetween": 16,
                                        "loop": false,
                                        "enableOn": "mobile",
                                        "pagination": {
                                            "el": ".c-swiper-pagination",
                                            "type": "custom"
                                        },
                                        "navigation": {
                                            "prevEl": ".c-swiper-button-prev",
                                            "nextEl": ".c-swiper-button-next"
                                        }
                                    }'
                                >
                                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="c-step-by-step__item" data-index="1">
                                            <picture>
                                                <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-1.webp" />
                                                <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-1-mob.webp" alt="Step 1: Remove from packaging" />
                                            </picture>
                                            <article>
                                                <h6>Step 1 <small>Remove from packaging</small></h6>
                                                <p>Remove the device from its sterile packaging and take off the protective cap.</p>
                                                <p><strong>No setup required.</strong> The needle head and serum vial are already integrated into your Micro-Infusion Pro Hair device.</p>
                                            </article>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="c-step-by-step__item" data-index="2">
                                            <picture>
                                                <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-2-v2.webp" />
                                                <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-2-mob-v2.webp" alt="Step 2: Begin the treatment" />
                                            </picture>
                                            <article>
                                                <h6>Step 2 <small>Begin the treatment</small></h6>
                                                <p>Part the hair into sections to clearly expose the scalp.<br /><br />Place the device straight against the exposed scalp and gently press straight down to begin.</p>
                                                <p><strong>Serum taking a while to appear? This is normal.</strong></p>
                                                <p>Micro-Infusion Pro Hair uses an airless pump system.<br /><br /><strong>It may take up to 15-20 pumps before serum begins to dispense.</strong> This is completely normal and does not mean your device is faulty.<br /><br />Continue gently stamping until serum begins to appear around the needle head.</p>
                                                <p>If serum flow appears slow, continue stamping gently.<br /><strong>Do not shake the device or apply excessive pressure to make the serum flow.</strong></p>
                                            </article>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="c-step-by-step__item" data-index="3">
                                            <picture>
                                                <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-3.webp" />
                                                <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-3-mob-v2.webp" alt="Step 3: Stamp the entire scalp" />
                                            </picture>
                                            <article>
                                                <h6>Step 3 <small>Stamp the entire scalp</small></h6>
                                                <p>Continue parting the hair into sections so the device can make direct contact with the scalp.</p>
                                                <p>Work systematically across the entire scalp.</p>
                                                <p>Stamp straight down using gentle pressure, then lift before moving to the next area.</p>
                                                <p><strong>Do not drag or slide the device across the scalp.</strong><br /><br />Slightly overlap each stamp for even coverage.<br /><br />Complete <strong>2–3 stamping</strong> passes across the entire scalp.<br /><br />Avoid stamping directly over broken, irritated or inflamed areas. Use lighter pressure on more sensitive areas.</p>
                                            </article>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="c-step-by-step__item" data-index="4">
                                            <picture>
                                                <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-4-v2.webp" />
                                                <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-4-mob-v2.webp" alt="Step 4: Apply any remaining serum" />
                                            </picture>
                                            <article>
                                                <h6>Step 4 <small>Apply any remaining serum</small></h6>
                                                <p>After completing 2–3 stamping passes:</p>
                                                <ol>
                                                    <li>Place the protective cap back onto the needle head.</li>
                                                    <li>Carefully unscrew the needle head from the device.</li>
                                                    <li>Pour any remaining serum into clean hands.</li>
                                                    <li>Gently massage the serum into the scalp.</li>
                                                    <li>Leave on overnight.</li>
                                                </ol>
                                            </article>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="c-step-by-step__item" data-index="5">
                                            <picture>
                                                <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-5.webp" />
                                                <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/step-5-mob.webp" alt="Step 5: Dispose after use" />
                                            </picture>
                                            <article>
                                                <h6>Step 5 <small>Dispose after use</small></h6>
                                                <p>Each Micro-Infusion Pro Hair device is designed for <strong>one treatment only.</strong></p>
                                                <p>After treatment:</p>
                                                <ol>
                                                    <li>Place the protective cap securely back onto the needle head.</li>
                                                    <li>Reattach the needle head to the device so the complete device is back in one piece.</li>
                                                    <li>Place the entire used device into a sharps container.</li>
                                                    <li>Dispose of the sharps container according to your local sharps-disposal requirements.</li>
                                                </ol>
                                                <p><strong>Do not place the used Micro-Infusion Pro in household waste or recycling.</strong><br /><br />Never reuse the device or needle head.</p>
                                            </article>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="c-swiper-nav">
                                        <button class="c-swiper-button-prev"></button>
                                        <div class="c-swiper-pagination"></div>
                                        <button class="c-swiper-button-next"></button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="shopify-section shopify-section--guide-content">
        <section class="guide-content" id="care-and-tips-tab">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="accordion">
                    <button
                        class="accordion-button"
                        type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                        data-bs-target="#care-and-tips-collapse"
                    >
                        Post-Treatment Care &amp; Tips
                    </button>
                    <div
                        id="care-and-tips-collapse"
                        class="accordion-collapse"
                    >
                        <article>
                            <h2>Post-Treatment Care &amp; Tips</h2>
                            <h6>Immediately after treatment.</h6>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Leave the Micro-Infusion Hair Serum on the scalp overnight.</li>
                                <li>Avoid touching, rubbing or scratching the treated scalp.</li>
                                <li>Do not apply additional scalp products immediately after treatment.</li>
                                <li>Avoid excessive heat and sweating.</li>
                                <li>Avoid hot showers, saunas and steam rooms.</li>
                                <li>Protect exposed areas of the scalp from direct sunlight.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>Mild redness, warmth, tingling or sensitivity may occur immediately after treatment and should gradually settle.</p>
                            <h6>The morning after:</h6>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Do not wash your hair or scalp for at least 24 hours after treatment.</li>
                                <li>Avoid unnecessary styling products or leave-on scalp products.</li>
                                <li>Avoid scratching, rubbing or picking at the scalp.</li>
                                <li>Avoid excessive sweating and heat while the scalp is settling.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>Once 24 hours have passed, gradually resume your normal hair and scalp routine provided the scalp feels comfortable.</p>
                            <hr />
                            <h6 class="guide-content__trim">After 24 hours:</h6>
                            <p>Resume your regular gentle hair-care routine once the scalp feels comfortable.<br />Avoid harsh scalp exfoliation or anything that causes stinging, burning or irritation while the scalp is still sensitive.</p>
                            <div class="c-note c-note--info">
                                <p>For a complete Qure hair routine, pair your weekly Micro-Infusion Pro Hair treatment with:</p>
                                <p><a href="#">Qure Hair Renewal Serum</a><br />Use nightly between weekly Micro-Infusion treatments. Apply a few drops and gently massage into the scalp.</p>
                                <p><a href="#">Q-Renew LLLT Hair Growth Helmet</a><br />Use as directed as part of your regular hair-care routine. Use the helmet on a clean scalp before applying leave-on serums.</p>
                                <p>On your weekly Micro-Infusion day, the <a href="#">Q-Renew LLLT Hair Growth Helmet</a> can be used before your Micro-Infusion Pro Hair treatment.</p>
                            </div>
                            <hr />
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

