                        <article>
                            <h2>Learn About Your Device</h2>
                            <p>The Qure™ Micro-Infusion Pro Hair System features:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>20 × 0.5 mm micro-needles</strong></li>
                                <li><strong>24K gold-plated micro-needles</strong></li>
                                <li><strong>4 mL Micro-Infusion Hair Serum</strong></li>
                                <li>Integrated, pre-attached needle head and serum vial</li>
                                <li>Airless pump system</li>
                                <li>Sterile, single-use design</li>
                                <li>No assembly required</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>The system is designed to make scalp treatment simple and consistent while automatically dispensing serum during stamping.</p>
                            <div class="guide-device">
                                <div class="guide-device__text">
                                    <h6 class="guide-content__trim">How it works:</h6>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>As you stamp, the integrated airless pump gradually dispenses Micro-Infusion Hair Serum around the micro-needles at the scalp surface.</li>
                                        <li>Parting the hair into sections allows the device to make direct contact with the scalp and helps you work systematically across the entire treatment area.</li>
                                        <li>Micro-Infusion Pro Hair combines precision micro-stamping and serum application in one weekly treatment.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                                <picture>
                                    <img src="assets/images/mi-hair-guide/device-diagram.svg" alt="Micro-Infusion Pro Hair device: 0.5 mm needle length, 24K gold plated micro-needles, 20 pcs stainless steel needles, 4 mL capacity" width="331" height="254" />
                                </picture>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
