                        class="accordion-collapse"
                    >
                        <article>
                            <h2>Schedule &amp; Set Reminders</h2>
                            {{> c-app-stores }}
                            <p><strong>How often to use Micro-Infusion Pro:</strong></p>
                            <p>Perform one Micro-Infusion Pro Hair treatment every week.<br />Do not perform more than one treatment within a 7-day period.</p>
                            <p class="guide-content__gap">The Qure app supports your Micro-Infusion Pro routine by keeping everything simple.</p>
