                        <article>
                            <h2>Safety Precautions</h2>
                            <p>The Qure™ Micro-Infusion Pro Hair System is designed for personal at-home use only.</p>
                            <h6 class="guide-content__trim"><strong>Do not use Micro-Infusion Pro Hair:</strong></h6>
                            <ul>
                                <li>On open wounds or broken skin</li>
                                <li>On active scalp infections or significantly irritated areas</li>
                                <li>More than once per week</li>
                                <li>With another serum or scalp formula inside the device</li>
                                <li>If the sterile packaging has already been opened or damaged</li>
                                <li>With a previously used device or needle head</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h6 class="guide-content__trim"><strong>Consult your doctor or dermatologist before treatment if:</strong></h6>
                            <ul>
                                <li>You have a significant scalp or skin condition.</li>
                                <li>You have a history of significant reactions following cosmetic treatments.</li>
                                <li>You have a condition that may affect normal healing.</li>
                                <li>You use prescription scalp treatments and are unsure whether they can be used alongside Micro-Infusion.</li>
                                <li>You are pregnant or breastfeeding.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="c-note c-note--warning">
                                <p>Discontinue treatment if significant irritation occurs and consult a medical professional if needed.<br />Keep out of reach of children.</p>
                            </div>
                            <hr />
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
